OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FChangeable with a little rain at
OL,7,Ftimes, interspersed with drier,
OL,8,Fbrighter periods. Temperatures above
OL,9,Fnormal at first, but trending nearer
OL,10,Fnormal later.
